WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,750
There are six stone pillars in the yard

2
00:00:01,750 --> 00:00:03,030
Only five keys

3
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:04,950
Wolf Chef can only guard one at a time

4
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:06,630
There are also five belts on the door

5
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:08,630
Longdao 999 number password change

6
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:11,140
To get the key, you have to crack the door code.

7
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:13,020
The more people there are, the more powerful it is for us

8
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,300
I'm going to save that damn fat guy

9
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:15,340
You crack it well

10
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:16,420
Call me if necessary

11
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:17,820
I will work hard

12
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:19,100
Senior, be careful

13
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:23,090
Damn it

14
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:24,530
Such bad luck

15
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:25,770
He was chased as soon as he came up

16
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:28,130
I didn’t expect that I would have to rely on two little kids.

17
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:30,990
If I had known better, I wouldn't have come to this shabby church.

18
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:38,240
Thank you, little brother, run away

19
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,520
I'll fix your password
